.DS_Store

# Real anonymizer rules stay local; only rules.sample.json is committed.
# The pattern covers every <db>_rules.json (auth, users, notifications, and any
# future one such as chat) so a newly added DB's rules can't be committed by
# accident — rules.sample.json does not match it and stays tracked.
rules.json
*_rules.json
